# Course Data Drill-down Implementation Plan

The goal is to allow users to "drill down" into all Canvas data for a module, specifically Modules, Pages, Files, and the Syllabus.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [MODIFY] [schemas/course.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/schemas/course.py)
Add new nested schemas for:
- `CanvasModuleNested`
- `CanvasModuleItemNested`
- `CanvasPageNested`
- `CanvasFileNested`
Update [CourseDetail](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/courses/%5Bid%5D/page.tsx#61-81) to include:
- `modules: List[CanvasModuleNested]`
- `pages: List[CanvasPageNested]`
- `files: List[CanvasFileNested]`
- `syllabus_body: Optional[str]`

#### [MODIFY] [routers/courses.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/routers/courses.py)
Update [get_course](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/routers/courses.py#73-129) endpoint to:
- Fetch [CanvasModule](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/canvas_module.py#9-29) and related [CanvasModuleItem](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/canvas_module.py#31-53)s.
- Fetch [CanvasPage](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/canvas_page.py#9-30)s for the course.
- Fetch [CanvasFile](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/canvas_file.py#8-30)s for the course.
- Include `syllabus_body` in the response (it's already in the model).

### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [[id]/page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/courses/[id]/page.tsx)
- Update [CourseDetail](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/courses/%5Bid%5D/page.tsx#61-81) interface.
- Add new [TabId](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/courses/%5Bid%5D/page.tsx#37-38) types: [modules](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py#507-596), [pages](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py#598-678), [files](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/data/canvas_files), `syllabus`.
- Implement new tabs in the navigation and main content area.
- Create components for:
  - `ModulesTab`: Collapsible module list with items.
  - `PagesTab`: List of wiki pages with a simple text viewer.
  - `FilesTab`: List of files organized by folder path.
  - `SyllabusTab`: HTML renderer for the syllabus body.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run backend tests to ensure [get_course](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/routers/courses.py#73-129) returns the new data correctly.
- `pytest backend/tests/test_routers/test_courses.py` (if it exists, otherwise I'll check [test_canvas_sync.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_services/test_canvas_sync.py) and potentially add a router test).

### Manual Verification
1.  Navigate to a course detail page.
2.  Switch to the "Modules" tab and verify the structure matches Canvas.
3.  Switch to "Pages" and view a wiki page's content.
4.  Switch to "Files" and verify folder paths and file metadata.
5.  Switch to "Syllabus" and verify the syllabus text is displayed.
